class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">⟨</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∫</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∂</span><span class=\"n\">μ</span><span class=\"o\">⟩</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">variable</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">MeasureSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">MeasureSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Y</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">U</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">NormedAddCommGroup</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">U</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">NormedSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℝ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">U</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bind_eq_giry_bind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">μ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Measure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Kernel</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Y</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">U</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Integrable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">μ.bind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">μ.toM</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toM</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">pure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">μ.bind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toM.eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kd\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Bind.bind</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Pure.pure</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Measure.toM</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Measure.comp_eq_comp_const_apply</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊢</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Kernel.integral_comp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hf</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">symm</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n</div></div>",
        "id": 596240787,
        "sender_full_name": "Tomas Skrivan",
        "timestamp": 1779212017
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I've discussed this with <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"130195\">@Sebastian Graf</span> and <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"223948\">@David Ledvinka</span> in the past, and it's no longer the case that do notation requires an actual monad</p>",
        "id": 596300541,
        "sender_full_name": "Bhavik Mehta",
        "timestamp": 1779230046
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I remember David mention something like that at ICERM, where can I find more? Or an example?</p>",
        "id": 596301091,
        "sender_full_name": "Tomas Skrivan",
        "timestamp": 1779230315
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I believe this is the PR that makes it possible: <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/pull/13507\">lean4#13507</a>.</p>",
        "id": 596301428,
        "sender_full_name": "David Ledvinka",
        "timestamp": 1779230467
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Yes, hopefully that core change gives us everything we need to have a do notation for random algorithms without too many workarounds (nice solution <span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"346070\">Tomas Skrivan</span> by the way!). Someone knows how to figure out in which Lean version this will become available?</p>",
        "id": 596352191,
        "sender_full_name": "Rémy Degenne",
        "timestamp": 1779256205
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>No idea, the test file does not exist under any tagged commits but is in master so maybe it will be part of v4.30.0-rc3</p>",
        "id": 596399603,
        "sender_full_name": "Tomas Skrivan",
        "timestamp": 1779270456
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>My attempt using the new do notation, \"works\" on nightly </p>\n<div class=\"spoiler-block\"><div class=\"spoiler-header\">\n<p>code</p>\n</div><div class=\"spoiler-content\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean.Parser</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean.Meta</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean.Elab</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean.Elab.Do</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean.Elab.Term</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">set_option</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">backward.do.legacy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">false</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MeasureSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">where</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Measure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">MeasureSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Measure.pure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">MeasureSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Measure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">⟩</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Measure.bind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">MeasureSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">MeasureSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">mx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Measure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Measure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Measure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mx.value</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">randOps</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DoOps</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">mkPureApp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">eStx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Term.exprToSyntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Measure.pure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">eStx</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Term.elabTermEnsuringType</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">none</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">mkBindApp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">eStx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Term.exprToSyntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">kStx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Term.exprToSyntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">k</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Measure.bind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">eStx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">kStx</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Term.elabTermEnsuringType</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">none</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">isPureApp</span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e.isAppOfArity</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">``Measure.pure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">some</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e.appArg</span><span class=\"bp\">!</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">none</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">randKind</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"do_rand \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">doSeq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">term</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">term_elab</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">randKind</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kd\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">elabRand</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Term.TermElab</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">et</span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">do_rand</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">doSeq</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">throwUnsupportedSyntax</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">elabDoWith</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">randOps</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">doSeq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">et</span><span class=\"bp\">?</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MeasureSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">⟨⟩</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">uniform</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Measure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">⟩</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">#check</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">do_rand</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">42</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">#check</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">do_rand</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">uniform</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">#check</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">show</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Measure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">from</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">do_rand</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">uniform</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n</div></div>\n<p>There is an error under <code>uniform 10</code> saying</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mismatch</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">uniform</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span>\n<span class=\"n\">has</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">type</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">Measure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span>\n<span class=\"n\">but</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">expected</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">type</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">3</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>i.e. it is expecting that <code>Measure</code> has type <code>Type u -&gt; Type v</code> but <em>it does not</em>! It works for the example indexed monad</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IState</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">o</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">×</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">o</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>for which <code>IState  i o</code> has type <code>Type -&gt; Type</code> but that does not work for <code>Measure : (a : Type) -&gt; [MeasureSpace  a] -&gt; Type</code> where the \"index\" <code>MeasureSpace a</code> depends on the input type.</p>",
